DESCRIPTION >
    - Per-bucket contributor aggregate — bucket 3 only.
    - Built daily by `collection_insights_aggregate_copy_pipe_3.pipe`.
    - One row per collection that has activity rows in bucket 3.
    - Columns:
      - `collectionSlug`: Collection identifier (String).
      - `uniqueContributorCount`: Unique contributors in this bucket (UInt64).
      - `updatedAt`: Update timestamp (DateTime).

SCHEMA >
    `collectionSlug` String,
    `uniqueContributorCount` UInt64,
    `updatedAt` DateTime

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY collectionSlug
